WEBVTT

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:05.190
Just as was announced at 
yesterday's music festival,

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:06.950
today is finally the day when the joint event

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:08.990
between the three countries begins.

00:02:05.580 --> 00:02:09.020
Ahh, showering is the best way to start the day.

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:11.150
Union Fest

00:02:09.020 --> 00:02:10.270
Yeah!

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:11.830
Oh yeah, that reminds me.

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:13.700
At yesterday's meeting,

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:15.960
you know how the Biscottians were there, too?

00:02:15.960 --> 00:02:16.940
Yup.

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:18.310
Don't you think Ecle-chan

00:02:18.310 --> 00:02:20.610
was acting a little strange?

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:23.690
<i>Hi, Ecle!</i>

00:02:24.960 --> 00:02:25.610
<i>Huh?</i>

00:02:26.860 --> 00:02:30.000
She seemed to keep her 
distance from Sink.

00:02:30.390 --> 00:02:31.960
Sink looked surprised.

00:02:32.360 --> 00:02:34.560
I wonder if something happened.

00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:35.840
Do you think they had 
a fight or something?

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:38.020
Sink looked like he

00:02:38.020 --> 00:02:40.300
didn't have any idea what was wrong.

00:02:41.570 --> 00:02:43.600
This is quite interesting.

00:02:45.660 --> 00:02:49.890
Yeah, Ecle's been quite distant.

00:02:50.260 --> 00:02:52.270
Are you sure you didn't do something

00:02:52.270 --> 00:02:53.560
to make her mad again?

00:02:53.750 --> 00:02:56.740
Well, Eclair is leaving 
her childhood behind,

00:02:56.740 --> 00:02:59.070
so she's got her moods.

00:02:59.550 --> 00:03:01.570
I'm sure you'll make up in no time.

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:03.070
I hope so.

00:03:03.540 --> 00:03:05.680
I'm sorry, Princess.

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:08.370
It looks like Cou-sama is 
totally enamored with Sink.

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:11.080
No need to apologize. 
Isn't it kind of heartwarming?

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:13.950
Oh, Cou-sama, how are you on time?

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:15.920
Oh, yeah.

00:03:16.230 --> 00:03:18.550
I guess I should get going.

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:24.200
Hero Sink, your lap was 
excellent for resting on.

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:25.800
Thank you.

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:28.560
Bye, Millhi-nee, Sink.

00:03:29.260 --> 00:03:32.470
Once the war starts, we'll be enemies.

00:03:32.470 --> 00:03:33.150
Understood.

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:34.310
We won't hold back!

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:36.570
It'll be fair and square.

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:38.810
See you later.

00:03:38.810 --> 00:03:40.570
Indeed!

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:46.580
It's finally the opening day.

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:50.210
It looks like today will 
be full of excitement.

00:03:50.210 --> 00:03:54.380
Yes. I'm sure it'll be a 
lot of fun with everybody.

00:03:58.460 --> 00:04:04.510
Biscotti Front Lines

00:04:01.020 --> 00:04:03.730
Captain! Everybody under the command

00:04:03.730 --> 00:04:05.460
of the Imperial Guard has been deployed!

00:04:05.460 --> 00:04:08.520
Please get some rest 
until the event begins.

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:09.470
If you'll excuse us...

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:10.710
We'll see you on the battlefield.

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:17.150
Looks like Emilio and Ange 
are both quite excited.

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:18.060
Yeah.

00:04:19.090 --> 00:04:22.820
Both of them are in line for 
a promotion to captain soon,

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:24.840
so of course they are.

00:04:30.740 --> 00:04:32.560
The Knights of Biscotti

00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:34.910
are becoming stronger and stronger.

00:04:34.910 --> 00:04:36.830
That's a good thing.

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:39.420
You're right, that is a good thing.

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:40.760
Still...

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:43.220
you seem like something 
is really eating at you.

00:04:43.660 --> 00:04:45.090
What are you talking about?

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:50.140
I've told you again and 
again, it's about the Hero.

00:04:50.730 --> 00:04:53.320
I've known you for a long time.

00:04:53.320 --> 00:04:56.600
Even if you try to talk around 
it, I can see through you.

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:06.450
Ecle, you love the Hero.

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:09.490
You love that he always has a 
smile for you when he sees you.

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:12.750
That he can run into battle 
at the same speed as you.

00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:15.260
That he always expresses his trust,

00:05:15.260 --> 00:05:17.750
courtesy, and gratitude in words.

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:20.110
But since you're so serious,

00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:21.700
you're actually ashamed

00:05:21.700 --> 00:05:25.370
that you're wondering 
if you love him or not.

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:28.490
Not to mention, there are a whole lot

00:05:28.490 --> 00:05:31.010
of wonderful girls around the Hero.

00:05:31.460 --> 00:05:35.430
So you're like, "I'm just a knight,"

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:38.020
or "I'm the captain of the Imperial 
Guard," and you keep worrying.

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:39.610
No, you're...

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:41.980
Getting angry won't work with me.

00:05:42.640 --> 00:05:45.530
Truth be told, I am a little 
angry today myself.

00:05:47.070 --> 00:05:47.780
I'm sorry.

00:05:49.480 --> 00:05:52.060
I do know that you love the Hero,

00:05:52.470 --> 00:05:54.200
but I am really...

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:56.790
No, no. That's not true.

00:05:57.220 --> 00:06:00.780
It is true that I really 
like the Hero a lot,

00:06:00.780 --> 00:06:04.800
but I do not hide that from anybody.

00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:09.070
The reason I am angry is 
that you still

00:06:09.070 --> 00:06:11.230
haven't managed to become true to yourself

00:06:11.230 --> 00:06:12.800
and you keep everything locked up inside.

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:16.910
I told you it's not that...

00:06:16.910 --> 00:06:18.870
Anyway, it doesn't matter right now.

00:06:19.450 --> 00:06:21.310
It's not a matter that should 
be discussed here and now.

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:23.820
Now's the only time to discuss it!

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:27.510
Everybody is worried about you.

00:06:27.510 --> 00:06:29.210
Just leave me alone.

00:06:29.210 --> 00:06:31.900
You don't have to worry, 
I'll do my part in the war.

00:06:31.900 --> 00:06:35.530
See! That's the sort of 
deflection I detest!

00:06:41.940 --> 00:06:43.340
So now you're ignoring me?

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:46.840
You're not being cool right now...

00:06:47.950 --> 00:06:50.030
I'm fine with being uncool.

00:06:50.030 --> 00:06:52.090
I don't have courage and 
I'm not being honest.

00:06:52.780 --> 00:06:55.330
If you want to think that's 
pathetic, go ahead.

00:06:55.330 --> 00:06:58.030
That's not what I meant at all!

00:06:58.030 --> 00:06:58.850
I just...

00:06:58.850 --> 00:07:00.100
I don't give a damn!

00:07:00.490 --> 00:07:02.350
I told you to leave me alone.

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:05.090
There's an important war today!

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:07.340
Let me concentrate.

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:11.360
I felt the need to talk about this,

00:07:12.400 --> 00:07:14.810
especially because 
it's an important war.

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:18.530
Because today's a very special event

00:07:18.530 --> 00:07:20.360
that'll stay in our hearts.

00:07:22.970 --> 00:07:25.710
Ecle you... Ecle...

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:29.460
I hate you!

00:07:38.980 --> 00:07:41.200
I'm so sorry.

00:07:41.200 --> 00:07:42.890
It's the Queen of Inventions.

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:44.400
What's the matter?

00:07:44.910 --> 00:07:46.830
Rico, are you all right?

00:07:46.830 --> 00:07:49.400
Leon-sama, Noir...

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:53.910
I see, so a trivial argument 
escalated into a fight.

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:56.110
It happens all the time.

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:58.940
Once we've cooled our heads,

00:07:58.940 --> 00:08:01.300
we usually both apologize and make up.

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:05.080
Well, the cause of the 
fight must be Sink, right?

00:08:06.030 --> 00:08:08.840
Because you're still not 
being honest about him,

00:08:08.840 --> 00:08:11.070
you're making everybody worry.

00:08:13.330 --> 00:08:15.830
Well, love and affection are not

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:17.850
things where thinking helps, I hear.

00:08:19.110 --> 00:08:21.660
Even so, having someone you love,

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:24.940
then that's a fun and happy thing.

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:27.100
I'm sure that's the sort of message

00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:29.190
Rico was trying share with you, too.

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:31.260
You should try to not think too hard

00:08:31.260 --> 00:08:33.530
and be more honest to yours-

00:08:35.770 --> 00:08:38.570
You disappoint me, 
Captain of the Imperial Guard.

00:08:51.320 --> 00:08:53.120
I heard your story.

00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:58.160
Eclaire, with that kind 
of weak attitude,

00:08:58.160 --> 00:09:00.520
you won't stand a chance in this war!

00:09:01.880 --> 00:09:04.500
However, as I too am a 
knight, I have to say

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:06.690
that I understand why you're so awkward.

00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:11.520
How about a little bet 
between us to make sure you

00:09:11.520 --> 00:09:13.320
don't have time to worry 
about trivial matters?

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:14.820
A bet?

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:17.820
Fight me one-on-one in today's battle.

00:09:19.590 --> 00:09:21.870
Obviously, the victor wins the bet.

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:24.440
Naturally, I'll give you an edge.

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:29.090
All you'll have to do is destroy 
my weapon or my armor.

00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:31.420
It goes without saying that 
I won't use Grand Vert.

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:33.270
What do you say?

00:09:33.270 --> 00:09:34.840
These conditions are 
quite extraordinary.

00:09:35.190 --> 00:09:37.890
That's certainly true, but...

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:39.050
What are we betting on?

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:42.080
If I win, you'll be 
Galette's Captain of the

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:44.060
Special Commando Troop for the day.

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:47.630
Then you'll be able to fight against

00:09:47.630 --> 00:09:52.440
your rivals in love, Millihi 
and Rebecca, all you want!

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:54.050
Hold on Leon-sama,

00:09:54.050 --> 00:09:56.050
I think you got the wrong idea...

00:09:56.050 --> 00:09:58.590
Not to mention, I don't have 
the authority to decide

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:00.300
something that big by myself.

00:10:00.300 --> 00:10:01.600
What?

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:04.950
You're that afraid of losing, 
even with this handicap?

00:10:05.320 --> 00:10:07.970
Have you really become this pathetic?

00:10:07.970 --> 00:10:09.110
And if I...

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:10.850
...win?

00:10:12.450 --> 00:10:14.460
I'll listen to any wish you might have.

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:17.550
Not that you could defeat 
me in your current state.

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:20.800
Fine, I'll show you.

00:10:23.920 --> 00:10:26.320
Eep, this got out of hand quickly...

00:10:26.320 --> 00:10:29.850
Don't worry, Leon-sama 
will handle this.

00:10:36.540 --> 00:10:39.110
Okay, it's almost time!

00:10:39.560 --> 00:10:42.450
Are you all ready?!

00:10:43.060 --> 00:10:45.620
This war will be carved into 
the history of the continent.

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:48.120
Naturally, she will be 
giving the start signal:

00:10:48.600 --> 00:10:51.010
Princess Millihiore!

00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:55.410
Hello!

00:10:55.410 --> 00:10:58.960
Hello!

00:10:58.960 --> 00:11:01.640
The joint event of the three 
countries, Union Fest...

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:04.140
is finally beginning!

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:07.620
Leon-sama, Cou-sama,

00:11:08.460 --> 00:11:10.390
are you ready?

00:11:10.390 --> 00:11:12.540
Yes, any time.

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:14.110
Of course!

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:17.750
The let's all call it together.

00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:18.650
Three...

00:11:18.950 --> 00:11:20.210
Two...

00:11:20.580 --> 00:11:21.660
One...

00:11:22.150 --> 00:11:23.160
Fight!

00:11:28.550 --> 00:11:29.880
It looks like battles

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:31.630
have already begun in several places.

00:11:36.200 --> 00:11:38.040
What is this?

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:40.710
Galette's general, Lady Leon,

00:11:40.710 --> 00:11:42.720
has broken rank and is charging ahead!

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:56.690
Oh! Could her aim be 
Biscotti's second squad?

00:11:57.250 --> 00:11:58.200
Captain!

00:11:58.200 --> 00:11:59.690
Captain, your orders?

00:12:01.340 --> 00:12:02.360
Yeah...

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:05.570
Meanwhile, the princess has returned

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:09.860
to Biscotti's main camp, after
 signaling the start of the event.

00:12:09.860 --> 00:12:11.510
She will now take command.

00:12:12.660 --> 00:12:15.190
Right. Let's begin 
our advance, as well.

00:12:15.190 --> 00:12:15.670
Okay!

00:12:20.660 --> 00:12:22.480
Couverte-sama and Hero Rebecca

00:12:22.480 --> 00:12:24.490
are moving in on Biscotti's main camp!

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:27.130
Eclaire and Lady Leon are moving

00:12:27.130 --> 00:12:28.530
towards Prizet bridge!

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:48.410
Now the captain of 
Biscotti's Imperial Guard

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:50.900
and the Ruler of the 
Lion Army are about to...

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:56.880
Bright Ice Blade!

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:04.550
CLASH!

00:13:17.880 --> 00:13:21.070
Your gear sure is 
flashy, but it's weak.

00:13:22.450 --> 00:13:23.840
Just like your friends worried:

00:13:23.840 --> 00:13:25.540
if you have doubts in your heart,

00:13:25.540 --> 00:13:27.510
your sword will waver 
and your Bright Power

00:13:27.510 --> 00:13:28.820
will become unstable.

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:32.190
Right now, you're totally useless!

00:13:38.260 --> 00:13:41.570
Put your spirit into it and come at me!

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:47.590
I do have spirit.

00:13:48.480 --> 00:13:50.640
This crazy one-on-one fight...

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:52.350
If I lose...

00:13:55.490 --> 00:13:57.210
I can't return to my country.

00:14:00.130 --> 00:14:02.500
If you lose, you won't 
be obligated to return.

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:04.900
Isn't that fitting?

00:14:29.600 --> 00:14:32.530
Lady Leon's seal cannon!

00:14:37.930 --> 00:14:41.180
But Knight Eclair is displaying 
amazing spirit here!

00:15:14.190 --> 00:15:15.810
Blast Wave!

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:29.570
Falling Doom!

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:34.580
A devastating blow!

00:15:35.150 --> 00:15:38.670
Is Captain Eclaire in danger?

00:15:40.270 --> 00:15:41.520
Ecle...

00:15:54.350 --> 00:15:56.010
I guess it wasn't a full hit.

00:15:59.860 --> 00:16:02.520
Ugh, I want to go cheer her on.

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:04.270
We have to stand our ground, Hero!

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:08.010
Lady Leon is approaching 
Captain Eclaire.

00:16:08.010 --> 00:16:11.030
Is this one-on-one coming to an end?!

00:16:12.960 --> 00:16:14.250
<i>My body...</i>

00:16:15.140 --> 00:16:16.750
<i>won't move.</i>

00:16:17.390 --> 00:16:19.560
<i>I ended up just like Rico and Yukikaze</i>

00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:21.200
<i>were worried I would.</i>

00:16:21.890 --> 00:16:23.570
<i>In this important war...</i>

00:16:23.570 --> 00:16:25.570
<i>in this one-on-one 
I can't afford to lose...</i>

00:16:25.570 --> 00:16:29.280
<i>I went into all this with so 
many doubts in my heart.</i>

00:16:33.090 --> 00:16:34.390
Now choose.

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:37.820
Do you want me to finish you off,

00:16:37.820 --> 00:16:39.060
or do you want to surrender?

00:16:39.630 --> 00:16:41.330
<i>If I'm like this,</i>

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:45.280
<i>Rico and the Hero might 
even turn away from me.</i>

00:16:45.280 --> 00:16:47.750
Knight Eclaire is in big trouble!

00:16:47.750 --> 00:16:51.310
Will Biscotti lose their Captain 
of the Imperial Guard?!

00:16:52.420 --> 00:16:54.360
Ecle, don't lose...

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:57.660
I want you to fight.

00:16:58.730 --> 00:17:02.610
I'm really sorry that I 
bugged you right before

00:17:02.610 --> 00:17:05.670
this important war and 
got in a fight with you.

00:17:06.440 --> 00:17:08.670
I was conceited and couldn't

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:11.180
actually tell you what I wanted.

00:17:12.200 --> 00:17:15.410
All I wanted to do was to cheer you on

00:17:15.410 --> 00:17:17.810
because you're too serious.

00:17:18.690 --> 00:17:25.190
When I said that I hate 
you, I was lying.

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:29.230
In reality, I love you!

00:17:30.340 --> 00:17:31.710
No matter what!

00:17:31.710 --> 00:17:33.690
Forever and ever!

00:17:40.890 --> 00:17:42.200
The fault...

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:46.980
lies with me...

00:17:49.600 --> 00:17:51.580
You didn't do anything wrong.

00:17:53.140 --> 00:17:54.800
And I...

00:17:55.950 --> 00:17:58.550
love you, too.

00:18:01.070 --> 00:18:04.560
Just like the princess and 
everybody in the Knight Corps...

00:18:05.240 --> 00:18:07.310
The country Biscotti...

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:11.070
and our Hero...

00:18:14.770 --> 00:18:18.100
Everybody that I met is important to me

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:22.930
I hold them dear and I 
don't want to betray them!

00:18:24.090 --> 00:18:25.830
That's why I won't lose.

00:18:29.200 --> 00:18:32.590
Big words, but what do you plan to do?

00:18:32.910 --> 00:18:33.750
I am going to win.

00:18:34.190 --> 00:18:37.590
I am going to defeat you 
and advance with our Hero.

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:40.560
Then we'll bring victory to Biscotti!

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:44.350
You eyes finally look 
like a knight's eyes.

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:48.600
Fine. Bring it!

00:18:49.880 --> 00:18:52.520
Captain Eclaire has recovered!

00:18:54.650 --> 00:18:55.670
But what will she...

00:18:56.470 --> 00:18:57.300
Here I go...

00:18:58.940 --> 00:18:59.990
Bright Power release!

00:19:02.480 --> 00:19:04.970
Bright Ice Blade! Dual wield!

00:19:04.970 --> 00:19:05.660
What?!

00:19:09.850 --> 00:19:10.900
Air Splitting

00:19:10.900 --> 00:19:11.990
Bright

00:19:11.990 --> 00:19:14.360
Cross Slash!

00:19:18.650 --> 00:19:20.800
<i>This is actually quite...</i>

00:19:38.630 --> 00:19:39.990
I win.

00:19:40.390 --> 00:19:41.180
Damn.

00:19:45.460 --> 00:19:47.000
Looks like you're right.

00:19:47.500 --> 00:19:49.000
Fair and square.

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:53.000
Captain Eclaire has won!

00:19:53.610 --> 00:19:56.050
Her Bright Power move has cleanly

00:19:56.050 --> 00:20:00.150
destroyed Lady Leon's sword and armor!

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:08.270
My my, I let my guard down.

00:20:08.670 --> 00:20:11.020
My lady, thank you.

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:12.560
How was it?

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:15.370
Putting your feelings into words?

00:20:15.370 --> 00:20:16.870
Did it help you a bit?

00:20:17.830 --> 00:20:19.030
Quite a bit.

00:20:19.410 --> 00:20:22.490
I am going to stop mulling 
over things by myself.

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:24.950
Should you have any 
problems regarding love,

00:20:24.950 --> 00:20:26.030
come talk to me.

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:29.000
Castle Vannette is all women,

00:20:29.000 --> 00:20:31.870
so I understand the female heart.

00:20:32.260 --> 00:20:35.630
Then I will take that 
right as my reward.

00:20:36.690 --> 00:20:38.630
Very well, it's a promise then.

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:41.560
The war's just begun.

00:20:41.560 --> 00:20:43.510
Let us return to our places.

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:44.390
Yes.

00:20:44.390 --> 00:20:47.370
With that, the one-on-one

00:20:47.370 --> 00:20:49.390
on the Prizet Bridge goes to Biscotti!

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:51.900
It's a retreat rather than a defeat,

00:20:51.900 --> 00:20:55.440
but it still gives a huge 
boost to Biscotti's score.

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:57.150
Ecle!

00:21:06.510 --> 00:21:09.950
I apologize. I worried you.

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:10.830
Not at all.

00:21:11.340 --> 00:21:12.310
Now let's go.

00:21:12.670 --> 00:21:14.830
Let us advance together, 
just as we planned!

00:21:15.120 --> 00:21:16.080
Okay!

00:21:16.630 --> 00:21:19.020
What's happening at 
Biscotti's main camp

00:21:19.020 --> 00:21:21.020
after the victory of their captain?

00:21:21.020 --> 00:21:24.650
I see the princess's 
favorite Blanchir, Harlan, out...

00:21:24.650 --> 00:21:26.340
Could this mean...

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:29.310
Eclaire was so cool.

00:21:29.310 --> 00:21:32.200
I hope you'll pet her a lot later.

00:21:32.200 --> 00:21:33.430
Of course!

00:21:34.810 --> 00:21:36.410
It looks like the princess and the chief

00:21:36.410 --> 00:21:39.270
will go up into the skies together.

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:41.660
It's finally time.

00:21:41.660 --> 00:21:42.280
Yes!

00:21:42.660 --> 00:21:45.230
Here we go, Princess.

00:21:45.230 --> 00:21:46.000
Right!

00:21:50.940 --> 00:21:52.580
I am going to fight Rebecca-san

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:55.040
without holding back, too.

00:23:30.700 --> 00:23:33.020
Even if we didn't get 
much screen time...

00:23:33.020 --> 00:23:34.320
We still are...

00:23:34.320 --> 00:23:35.540
Genoise!

00:23:35.140 --> 00:23:45.000
<b>One-On-One In The Skies and On Land!</b>

00:23:35.540 --> 00:23:36.290
Don't forget it!

00:23:36.290 --> 00:23:36.830
Owww!

00:23:36.830 --> 00:23:37.960
Hero!

00:23:37.960 --> 00:23:40.060
I'm going to shine next time!
